WEBVTT

00:14.170 --> 00:15.380
Lambda!

00:16.290 --> 00:17.500
Oh, it's you.

00:17.710 --> 00:21.460
I'm guessing the fact that you're here
means that this is all the reinforcements?

00:21.630 --> 00:24.960
No, I'm going right back to
organize the next batch.

00:25.210 --> 00:28.460
There was just something I wanted
to confirm with people on-site.

00:28.750 --> 00:29.960
And that is?

00:30.130 --> 00:31.460
Number 666...

00:31.920 --> 00:33.670
Princess Rose Oriana?

00:33.670 --> 00:36.000
I heard that she took it upon herself
to join up with the enemy.

00:36.290 --> 00:38.790
It was a perfect storm of unfavorable conditions.

00:38.790 --> 00:42.040
It may be a little harsh to call
what she did "betrayal."

00:42.040 --> 00:43.250
I see.

00:43.250 --> 00:47.250
But the fact remains that her insubordination
put her teammates in danger.

00:47.540 --> 00:49.670
I was her instructor.

00:49.920 --> 00:55.040
If the organization is to render judgment on her,
then the least I can do is carry it out myself.

00:55.460 --> 00:57.210
Unfortunately, that won't be possible.

00:57.210 --> 01:00.460
Not even the Seven Shadows have authority
over this matter anymore.

01:00.460 --> 01:02.080
Not even the Seven Shadows?

01:02.380 --> 01:03.630
You don't mean...

01:04.080 --> 01:06.420
Our fearless leader, Lord Shadow himself?

01:06.790 --> 01:11.250
Lord Shadow has rendered merciless judgment
on all who have stood against us.

01:11.250 --> 01:13.210
No power or authority can stop him.

01:13.210 --> 01:15.710
It is all meaningless before him.

01:16.040 --> 01:19.000
I agree that the princess's behavior was problematic,

01:19.000 --> 01:20.460
but that's just too...

01:21.130 --> 01:22.330
No...

01:22.630 --> 01:26.580
No one in the world could ever defy
his magnificent will.

01:26.580 --> 01:29.920
I have no doubt the princess
will meet a fitting end.

01:33.710 --> 01:37.420
Then there is no longer anything we can do?

01:43.630 --> 01:45.750
That is too late

01:45.750 --> 01:48.670
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

01:48.670 --> 01:50.790
That is to say...

01:53.750 --> 01:59.960
The first move chooses an unknown future
Saisho no itte de erabu michi naru future<b></b>

01:59.960 --> 02:02.290
How it will be
Sono arisama<b></b>

02:02.630 --> 02:03.750
This way

02:03.750 --> 02:10.000
The last move decides the world's answer
Saigo no itte de kimeru sekai no answer<b></b>

02:10.000 --> 02:12.630
A single winner
Hitori no winner<b></b>

02:12.630 --> 02:14.000
It's me

02:14.250 --> 02:16.540
These eyes have seen it
Kono me wa misueta<b></b>

02:18.040 --> 02:23.630
The optimal solution no one has yet been able to discern
Dare mo imada mitoosenu saitekikai o<b></b>

02:24.920 --> 02:28.750
It's all a game to control the board
Subete wa banjou shihai suru game<b></b>

02:28.750 --> 02:31.250
A battle of thought
Shikou no tousou<b></b>

02:31.420 --> 02:33.790
I disguise even my mistakes
Mistake sae mo gisou shite<b></b>

02:33.790 --> 02:36.380
And even checkmate is a preparatory move
Checkmate made fuseki toshite<b></b>

02:36.380 --> 02:38.790
A game to take each other's king
King o ubaiau game<b></b>

02:38.790 --> 02:41.250
Ideology and desire
Shisou to yokubou<b></b>

02:41.540 --> 02:43.920
A bad move to not let one chance get away
One chance minogasanu akushu<b></b>

02:43.920 --> 02:46.580
The last chance will cinch it
Last chance kanarazu shitomeru<b></b>

02:46.830 --> 02:48.830
That is too late

02:48.830 --> 02:51.750
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

02:51.750 --> 02:53.920
That is to say

02:53.920 --> 02:58.880
Total victory is in my hands
Kanzen shouri wa kono te no naka ni<b></b>

03:04.170 --> 03:06.960
No one can catch up now
Dare nimo mou oitsukenai<b></b>

03:08.130 --> 03:13.000
<b>#10 Caged Bird</b>

03:11.500 --> 03:12.880
What makes those barbarians think

03:12.880 --> 03:14.670
they can throw their weight around here?

03:14.670 --> 03:17.130
It's all because of that father-murdering princess.

03:17.460 --> 03:20.040
Prices have all gone up,
my ma's cooking tastes like crap.

03:20.040 --> 03:21.710
All 'cause of that damn princess.

03:22.000 --> 03:23.500
She really needs to pay.

03:23.920 --> 03:25.380
"Rose Oriana...

03:26.380 --> 03:28.290
I adamantly oppose your marriage!"

03:28.670 --> 03:30.080
That's a good line.

03:30.960 --> 03:33.290
But it's broad daylight,
so appearing from the sky isn't exactly...

03:33.540 --> 03:36.130
This calls for a quick hop over the gate.

03:36.380 --> 03:39.540
Now is the time for my polished
teleportation skills to shine.

03:40.040 --> 03:40.420
So onward, to-

03:40.420 --> 03:41.630
Lord Shadow!
So onward, to-<b></b>

03:41.630 --> 03:42.830
I mean, Cid!

03:43.130 --> 03:44.960
Cid, it's good to see you again!

03:45.290 --> 03:47.420
Epsilon, what a coincidence.

03:47.420 --> 03:48.630
I know, right?

03:49.500 --> 03:51.170
Are you here about the problem?

03:51.170 --> 03:52.920
Yes, the problem.

03:53.170 --> 03:55.330
You arrived at just the right time, Epsilon.

03:55.330 --> 03:56.670
You flatter me!

03:56.920 --> 03:59.790
Surely you granted me these powers

03:59.790 --> 04:02.290
because you knew you would need them
at exactly a time like this.

04:02.500 --> 04:05.580
In this country, they respect anyone
whose art warrants it,

04:05.580 --> 04:07.420
regardless of race or rank.

04:07.710 --> 04:11.540
That's why I'm allowed to walk right into
the royal palace whenever I want to.

04:11.540 --> 04:15.630
And why I, your "number one student,"
am allowed to accompany you.

04:15.630 --> 04:17.250
I am so sorry about that.

04:17.250 --> 04:21.580
We both know that you, my Lord,
taught me everything I know about the piano.

04:21.960 --> 04:24.210
<i>Slime content: 99%.</i>

04:24.540 --> 04:28.960
<i>She's constantly adjusting it with intricate magic control
to make it move with her center of gravity.</i>

04:28.960 --> 04:33.250
<i>She's even incorporating chaos theory into this
excessively excess-avoidant excess of effort.</i>

04:33.960 --> 04:35.580
Is something on your mind?

04:36.040 --> 04:38.330
I guess I'm thinking about the fruit of all your effort.

04:38.330 --> 04:39.540
Oh, stop!

04:39.540 --> 04:41.460
I still have so very much to learn!

04:41.710 --> 04:44.040
We're keeping eyes on the target
while we let her roam free.

04:44.790 --> 04:47.130
Our spies have not been discovered.

04:47.460 --> 04:48.880
We're waiting for the right moment to-

04:48.880 --> 04:50.750
Well, if it isn't Ms. Shiron.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.920
Duke Perv Asshat...

04:54.330 --> 04:58.210
Were you scheduled to perform for us
at our luncheon today?

04:58.210 --> 05:00.000
Yes, Your Grace.

05:00.000 --> 05:02.880
I am planning to debut a new piece there.

05:03.130 --> 05:04.750
I look forward to hearing it.

05:04.750 --> 05:07.630
Every one of your compositions
is ahead of its time.

05:07.630 --> 05:09.330
It is a joy to listen to them.

05:09.670 --> 05:13.380
I only hope that my music can bring
some solace to Princess Rose,

05:13.380 --> 05:16.130
now that she's lost His Royal Majesty her father.

05:16.130 --> 05:17.750
I appreciate your concern.

05:18.330 --> 05:20.420
But I must apologize.

05:20.420 --> 05:22.710
Rose is not feeling well today,

05:22.710 --> 05:25.170
and it is unlikely that
she will be attending the luncheon.

05:25.880 --> 05:29.420
Oh, my, then as her fiance,
you must be very worried about her.

05:29.630 --> 05:30.630
That's all right.

05:30.630 --> 05:33.580
It is a husband's duty to support
the kingdom in his wife's place.

05:33.580 --> 05:35.790
<i>Duke Perv Asshat...
</i>You're so strong, Duke Asshat.<b></b>

05:36.080 --> 05:37.880
<i>Just look at him.</i>

05:37.880 --> 05:40.290
<i>He lives his entire life inside the
typical evil aristocrat mold.</i>

05:40.670 --> 05:43.130
<i>I guess if you can't just naturally master that mold,</i>

05:43.130 --> 05:45.500
<i>the road to being a named character must be rough.</i>

05:45.880 --> 05:47.750
Might I ask who this young man is?

05:48.420 --> 05:54.670
My grand, my sublime,
my one and only favorite pupil.

05:55.580 --> 05:57.080
A student, Ms. Shiron?

05:57.080 --> 05:58.790
I had no idea you took apprentices!

05:58.790 --> 06:00.750
We have a secret relationship.

06:01.040 --> 06:05.130
But, and I'm sorry to have to ask this,
does he have a pass to enter the palace?

06:05.130 --> 06:08.960
I thought if I brought him as my guest,
there should be no problem?

06:09.130 --> 06:12.670
My deepest apologies,
but we've had to change protocol.

06:12.670 --> 06:15.630
Oh, dear, in that case,
should we come back another day?

06:15.630 --> 06:17.920
No, there will be no need for that.

06:18.790 --> 06:21.960
All we need is for the boy to play a piece for us.

06:22.170 --> 06:26.830
After all, we're all beside ourselves with curiosity
over how skilled your apprentice is.

06:26.830 --> 06:28.540
<i>An abrupt unreasonable demand.</i>

06:28.540 --> 06:32.000
<i>He doesn't even let up on background characters.
I like his cookie-cutter villain style.</i>

06:32.000 --> 06:33.540
<i>That's the spirit.</i>

06:34.130 --> 06:38.290
<i>Then I'll respond as the type of background character
who's kinda good at the piano.</i>

06:38.290 --> 06:42.130
Ms. Shiron is, without a doubt,
the best pianist in the world.

06:42.130 --> 06:44.290
To think she had an apprentice.

06:44.290 --> 06:48.500
It would be cruel to expect too much of him,
but this should be an entertaining diversion.

06:48.790 --> 06:51.420
<i>The regular citizens are all so jaded and bitter,</i>

06:51.420 --> 06:53.790
<i>but the nobility are living their best lives
in the lap of luxury.</i>

06:54.040 --> 06:56.710
I will get vengeance for the blood tax
they have exacted from you.

07:17.830 --> 07:19.460
My, my...

07:20.210 --> 07:21.630
Beautiful...

07:26.380 --> 07:27.750
Magnificent!

07:27.750 --> 07:31.210
I can see the moonlight streaming
down on us from above.

07:46.830 --> 07:49.000
I'm so touched, I'm crying a flood of tears!

07:49.380 --> 07:52.210
We have witnessed the true, divine essence
of the "Moonlight Sonata."

07:52.210 --> 07:56.420
I, and the audience, will remember this moment
for the rest of our humble lives!

07:56.710 --> 08:00.670
O, young musical genius,
might I be so bold as to ask you your name?

08:00.670 --> 08:02.290
Oh, I'm...

08:02.750 --> 08:04.960
He's still in the middle of his education.

08:04.960 --> 08:07.630
We'll formally introduce him
once he's completed his training.

08:07.830 --> 08:11.330
But we're all dying to know more about him.

08:11.330 --> 08:13.170
Anyone here would love to be his patron.

08:13.170 --> 08:15.170
It's too soon to consider any of that.

08:15.170 --> 08:17.380
He will set foot on the public stage

08:17.380 --> 08:19.460
at the appropriate time
and in the appropriate place.

08:19.750 --> 08:23.500
And when the day arrives,
I'm sure the entire world will know his name.

08:23.500 --> 08:25.920
When that happens,
I do hope you'll come talk to me.

08:25.920 --> 08:28.750
I will spare no effort to prepare the most fitting setting
for the start of this new legend!

08:28.750 --> 08:29.790
Nor will I!

08:29.790 --> 08:31.000
Please, let me help!

08:31.000 --> 08:32.000
No, allow me!

08:36.420 --> 08:37.630
Master Shiron...

08:38.080 --> 08:42.170
While I'm here, I would like to take a look around
and see more of the palace.

08:43.170 --> 08:45.080
Yes, "while you're here."

08:45.080 --> 08:46.790
This is may be an excellent opportunity.

08:46.790 --> 08:48.880
In that case, allow me to show you around!

08:49.290 --> 08:50.290
No, I can go by myself-

08:50.290 --> 08:53.330
I could never be so rude as
to neglect you like that!

08:53.330 --> 08:54.330
No, I can go by myself-

08:54.330 --> 08:56.750
I'm the maid, my name is Margaret.

08:56.750 --> 08:59.500
I also happen to be entrusted with
the care of Princess Rose,

08:59.500 --> 09:01.460
so I know all about the palace.

09:01.460 --> 09:02.670
You care for Rose?

09:02.670 --> 09:04.210
This is your first time in the palace, no?

09:04.210 --> 09:07.210
Then I can show you all of the best places!

09:10.290 --> 09:12.080
Excuse me, miss!
Would you kindly stop-

09:12.080 --> 09:13.290
Slime content...

09:14.670 --> 09:16.080
Zero percent, eh?

09:19.710 --> 09:21.330
It is winter, isn't it?

09:21.330 --> 09:25.500
There's an artifact underground that
keeps the temperature constant.

09:26.630 --> 09:30.130
You know, I was so touched by
your performance earlier!

09:30.130 --> 09:33.380
Knowing you, I'm sure you'll be
a top class pianist in no time!

09:33.380 --> 09:36.710
That was more wonderful than any
piano performance I've ever heard in my life!

09:37.420 --> 09:40.250
<i>Yeah, because the performance
techniques in this world</i>

09:40.250 --> 09:42.500
<i>are pretty underdeveloped
compared to modern Japan.</i>

09:42.500 --> 09:47.250
I happened to overhear that Earl Patron
himself has his eye on you.

09:47.250 --> 09:49.250
If you become his personal pianist,

09:49.250 --> 09:51.420
you're guaranteed at least
a hundred million zeni a year.

09:51.420 --> 09:52.790
A hundred million zeni?!

09:52.790 --> 09:54.630
And they do annual salaries here?

09:54.630 --> 09:57.290
Marquis Newwealth spoke very highly of you, as well.

09:57.290 --> 10:02.170
Your salary would drop to seventy million,
but he has a broad network of connections,

10:02.170 --> 10:05.000
so if you're looking for fame,
you should go with Marquis Newwealth.

10:05.210 --> 10:07.330
<i>The future musician route, eh?</i>

10:07.330 --> 10:10.630
<i>If I get a yearly salary, I won't have to
count on handouts for every gig.</i>

10:10.630 --> 10:11.830
<i>That might actually work.</i>

10:11.960 --> 10:14.500
And I also recommend my own family.

10:14.500 --> 10:15.710
Your family?

10:15.710 --> 10:18.250
Our starting pay for musicians is fifty million,

10:18.250 --> 10:21.670
but I can talk to my father
and convince him to give you seventy.

10:21.790 --> 10:23.130
You can do that, eh?

10:23.130 --> 10:24.920
Just between you and me,

10:24.920 --> 10:29.830
I happen to be on very good terms with
both Earl Patron and Marquis Newwealth.

10:29.830 --> 10:32.750
If you would just let me handle everything,
I can work it all out perfectly.

10:32.880 --> 10:35.540
Yeah, but Master Shiron wouldn't...

10:35.630 --> 10:39.500
Lady Shiron only wants to keep her
darling little apprentice to herself.

10:39.500 --> 10:42.920
Don't worry about it,
and just leave it all to me, all right?

10:42.920 --> 10:44.830
I will do everything in my power to support you.

10:45.170 --> 10:45.830
Huh?

10:45.830 --> 10:48.670
Come to think of it,
you're Princess Rose's maid, right?

10:48.960 --> 10:50.460
Where is she now?

10:52.960 --> 10:55.670
You're interested in Princess Rose, Mr. Apprentice?

10:56.380 --> 10:58.830
Personally, I detest that woman.

10:59.580 --> 11:05.040
I was her personal maid even before
she left to study in the Midgar Kingdom.

11:05.580 --> 11:08.210
She was a little strange,

11:08.210 --> 11:10.580
taking an interest in barbaric arts like fencing.

11:10.580 --> 11:13.040
But she was kind, intelligent.

11:13.040 --> 11:15.290
Everyone loved our Princess Rose.

11:16.330 --> 11:17.540
But...

11:21.380 --> 11:24.380
Our kingdom is a shambles now,
and it's her fault.

11:25.460 --> 11:29.080
So, Mr. Apprentice, would you like to know
where you can find Princess Rose now?

11:29.080 --> 11:30.630
Yeah, kinda.

11:30.630 --> 11:31.830
Well...

11:32.130 --> 11:33.750
That's a secret.

11:33.750 --> 11:36.080
You certainly can't expect me to tell you.

11:36.080 --> 11:37.290
Oh, okay.

11:37.790 --> 11:39.040
But...

11:39.040 --> 11:40.250
But, well...

11:40.250 --> 11:41.630
Maybe just a little hint.

11:42.000 --> 11:43.670
<i>I thought I'd scared her off,
</i>I'll make an exception, just for you. All right?<b></b>

11:43.670 --> 11:45.210
<i>but she's already back and showing sympathy.
</i>I'll make an exception, just for you. All right?<b></b>

11:45.210 --> 11:47.250
<i>And showing her vulnerable side while she's at it.</i>

11:47.250 --> 11:48.830
<i>I know what this is.
</i>So please, don't tell anyone.<b></b>

11:48.830 --> 11:50.250
<i>She's trying to convert me to her religion.</i>

11:50.250 --> 11:53.580
Princess Rose has been locked up
at the top of the west tower.

11:53.830 --> 11:54.290
It will be our special secret, just between us!

11:54.290 --> 11:56.290
She's definitely Rose's maid.
It will be our special secret, just between us!<b></b>

11:56.290 --> 11:58.330
She uses the same proselytizing techniques.

11:58.330 --> 11:59.540
Hey!

12:00.000 --> 12:02.040
What are you doing, sneaking around here?

12:02.960 --> 12:04.170
Who are you?

12:04.170 --> 12:06.330
What? Can't you tell?

12:06.330 --> 12:08.040
I'm a castle guard!

12:08.040 --> 12:11.500
Is that too hard for the great musician to figure out?

12:12.040 --> 12:15.670
We Dark Knights get the same treatment
as any ordinary soldier

12:15.670 --> 12:18.330
while people like you are sitting pretty.

12:18.750 --> 12:19.960
I'm sorry?

12:19.960 --> 12:21.540
Don't look down us, jerk.

12:21.540 --> 12:23.710
We're the ones keeping the kingdom safe.

12:23.710 --> 12:27.210
You can call us barbarians,
but we're risking our lives here!

12:27.210 --> 12:30.630
While you're just kicking back and enjoying
attention from all the women in the palace!

12:30.830 --> 12:32.040
I'm sorry?

12:32.040 --> 12:34.920
Don't just stand there grinning.
Fight me!

12:34.920 --> 12:38.460
See if you can defeat the barbaric Dark Knight
with that music you're so proud of.

12:38.460 --> 12:39.670
I'm sorry?

12:39.960 --> 12:43.000
You're pathetic!
You're shaking in your boots!

12:43.000 --> 12:45.710
Musician, my ass!
The arts are a load of garbage!

12:45.710 --> 12:46.710
I'm sorry?

12:46.710 --> 12:49.830
Now that you know your place,
I expect you to never get near her again!

12:49.830 --> 12:53.630
My sweet little Maggie and I
are deeply in love, okay?!

12:53.630 --> 12:55.040
I'm sorr- What?

12:55.750 --> 12:59.830
Every single day, we come to this garden to
reaffirm our love for each other.

13:00.170 --> 13:03.670
I gaze at her, and my dear Meg Muffin
turns to see me...

13:04.130 --> 13:05.920
But she's such a bashful little thing.

13:05.920 --> 13:08.460
Her cheeks flush red,
and she scampers away from me.

13:08.460 --> 13:09.670
Isn't it adorable?

13:10.540 --> 13:12.830
But that's all either of us really needs.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.210
Do you understand?

13:14.210 --> 13:17.000
We know how each other feel,
from a mere meeting of the eyes.

13:18.250 --> 13:20.540
Oh, my Margie-Wargie!

13:20.540 --> 13:24.710
We haven't spoken a word to each other,
but your love is coming through loud and clear!

13:24.710 --> 13:26.380
I know love comes in all shapes and sizes,

13:26.380 --> 13:27.380
I know love comes in all shapes and sizes,
You must have been frightened by the approach of a real man!<b></b>

13:27.380 --> 13:28.670
but the fact that he doesn't see anything
You must have been frightened by the approach of a real man!<b></b>

13:28.670 --> 13:29.580
questionable in her reactions...
You must have been frightened by the approach of a real man!<b></b>

13:29.580 --> 13:31.670
questionable in her reactions...
I will go right now to comfort you!<b></b>

13:31.670 --> 13:33.830
I always knew religion was scary.
Me! I will comf...<b></b>

13:38.080 --> 13:40.750
I managed to protect my mother,

13:40.750 --> 13:42.170
but the kingdom...

13:42.580 --> 13:44.330
Shadow Garden is on the move.

13:44.920 --> 13:48.920
Now that I've turned traitor,
they won't give me a second thought.

13:49.460 --> 13:51.460
Then there's the Cult of Diablos.

13:51.880 --> 13:53.250
In the not too distant future,

13:53.250 --> 13:56.710
my kingdom will be the stage for a clash
between the two organizations.

13:57.290 --> 13:59.500
But as I am now...

14:06.920 --> 14:08.330
Without magic, that is not an easy climb.

14:08.330 --> 14:09.420
Cid!
Without magic, that is not an easy climb.<b></b>

14:09.420 --> 14:10.630
Rose...

14:11.920 --> 14:13.880
Cid... Cid...

14:14.540 --> 14:15.960
How I've longed to see you!

14:16.580 --> 14:18.670
Me, too, Rose.

14:18.960 --> 14:20.920
I had to see you, no matter what.

14:20.920 --> 14:23.130
There's something I've wanted to tell you.

14:24.630 --> 14:25.920
That's no reason to...

14:27.460 --> 14:29.880
But how in the world did you get here?

14:29.880 --> 14:33.000
I snuck in as the apprentice of
a pianist friend of mine.

14:33.000 --> 14:35.080
You did that for me?

14:35.580 --> 14:37.920
I want to talk to you about your marriage.

14:39.790 --> 14:41.210
There's nothing to talk about.

14:41.830 --> 14:43.630
It's not true, is it?
That you're getting married.

14:43.630 --> 14:44.960
It is true.

14:45.580 --> 14:48.540
I am going to marry Duke Perv Asshat.

14:48.540 --> 14:49.540
Lies!

14:49.540 --> 14:51.710
Please, you must remember!
Think back on that day!

14:52.500 --> 14:54.790
You told me that, come what may,
you would be a tyr-

14:54.790 --> 14:56.040
Cid!

14:56.380 --> 14:57.580
Please...

14:57.920 --> 14:59.790
Don't bring up that day.

14:59.790 --> 15:01.630
Don't think about me.

15:01.630 --> 15:03.170
Forget all about me.

15:03.420 --> 15:04.630
Rose...

15:06.290 --> 15:07.500
No, I can't.

15:07.880 --> 15:09.580
We're the same.

15:10.880 --> 15:13.710
Rose, you grew up in a kingdom
that looks down on fencers,

15:13.710 --> 15:15.250
but decided to be a Dark Knight.

15:15.630 --> 15:18.330
Your peers rejected you, no one understood you.

15:18.330 --> 15:19.670
You were alone.

15:20.000 --> 15:22.880
But you stay true to your chosen way of life.

15:23.170 --> 15:24.790
I'm just like you.

15:24.790 --> 15:26.420
You? Like me?

15:26.920 --> 15:30.580
No one understood my dream either.

15:30.580 --> 15:33.670
So I think I know better than anyone how you've felt.

15:34.040 --> 15:35.250
Cid...

15:35.830 --> 15:37.250
Your dream...

15:41.830 --> 15:43.040
I...

15:43.250 --> 15:45.540
I will understand your dream.

15:46.460 --> 15:49.710
Even if the whole world should
reject you, I will always...

15:50.710 --> 15:52.830
But the world does not agree.

15:53.210 --> 15:54.500
"Are you stupid?" they say.

15:54.500 --> 15:56.250
"Is something wrong with you?" they say.

15:56.250 --> 15:58.330
"Would you grow up already?" they say.

15:58.330 --> 16:00.250
I don't care what anyone says!

16:00.250 --> 16:02.920
Your dream is the most precious thing there is!

16:03.500 --> 16:04.710
Rose...

16:05.920 --> 16:08.250
We tried to stay true to our chosen ways of life.

16:08.790 --> 16:11.580
No matter the obstacles we faced,
no matter who rejected us,

16:11.580 --> 16:12.960
we stayed true to ourselves.

16:12.960 --> 16:14.330
But right now, Rose,

16:14.330 --> 16:15.960
you are perverting that way of life.

16:16.460 --> 16:17.830
P-perverting? No!

16:17.830 --> 16:20.630
You stabbed your fiance and killed your father!

16:21.920 --> 16:23.250
I won't ask you why,

16:23.250 --> 16:26.210
because I believe you did it out
of your own convictions

16:26.210 --> 16:28.420
to stay true to your chosen way of life.

16:28.750 --> 16:30.040
But why, after all that,

16:30.040 --> 16:32.380
are you doing something
to pervert that way of life now?

16:32.380 --> 16:33.580
I...

16:33.960 --> 16:36.170
Marrying the fiance you once stabbed

16:36.170 --> 16:38.210
is tantamount to perverting your way of life!

16:38.500 --> 16:40.420
But you've been true to it all this time!

16:40.830 --> 16:43.330
So why would you give that up now?!

16:47.170 --> 16:49.420
I have nothing left to tell you.

16:50.500 --> 16:53.630
Please, forget about me,
and find your own happiness.

16:53.630 --> 16:54.880
I can't!

16:54.880 --> 16:56.080
Rose, I need you-

16:56.080 --> 16:59.290
That is my one and only wish.

17:03.330 --> 17:06.000
I received a report that there
were voices in here.

17:06.420 --> 17:08.290
Does it look like I have a visitor?

17:11.460 --> 17:13.080
It seems you've been crying.

17:17.500 --> 17:19.170
Would you kindly refrain from touching m-

17:19.670 --> 17:21.380
Your attitude needs improvement.

17:21.580 --> 17:23.500
We will soon be husband and wife.

17:23.500 --> 17:26.330
We'll be married in name only...

17:27.250 --> 17:29.420
Mind your tongue.

17:29.920 --> 17:34.420
Don't forget that Queen Reina's life
depends on your agreeableness.

17:37.250 --> 17:38.460
Yes, sir.

17:38.880 --> 17:40.130
That's better.

17:41.040 --> 17:42.040
Come.

17:42.040 --> 17:43.790
We have a wedding to plan.

17:44.920 --> 17:45.920
Yes, sir.

17:45.920 --> 17:47.210
I see what's happening.

17:47.500 --> 17:49.960
I'm just going to have to switch to Plan B.

17:51.210 --> 17:55.960
Still, I wonder if this was supposed to be
the wedding ring or something?

17:56.460 --> 17:58.670
Maybe I shouldn't have taken it from Mr. Pervert.

18:03.670 --> 18:04.960
I believe this is a first?

18:04.960 --> 18:07.080
For you to fail a mission.

18:07.080 --> 18:08.670
My deepest apologies.

18:08.670 --> 18:11.210
I will dispose of Number 666 as quickly as possible.

18:11.330 --> 18:13.670
Her actions were thoughtless and hasty,

18:13.670 --> 18:16.130
but I suspect it's too soon
to declare her a traitor just yet.

18:16.130 --> 18:17.330
But...

18:17.460 --> 18:19.830
Your loyalty is quite admirable.

18:20.290 --> 18:22.130
But it is possible to take it too far.

18:22.330 --> 18:26.750
I intend to eventually promote you to a position
directly below the Seven Shadows.

18:26.750 --> 18:28.210
Do not disappoint me.

18:28.630 --> 18:29.830
I understand.

18:30.250 --> 18:33.210
Besides, this failure was not your fault.

18:33.670 --> 18:38.170
This is our responsibility, for not telling
Princess Rose about her mother.

18:38.500 --> 18:42.080
We had no idea they would bring
Queen Reina to the First Ruins.

18:42.540 --> 18:46.080
It was the Seven Shadows' mistake that put
the two of them in the same place.

18:46.420 --> 18:47.630
You couldn't have...

18:48.250 --> 18:50.670
We never meant to lie to her about it,

18:50.670 --> 18:52.790
but we hoped she would never find out.

18:53.250 --> 18:56.170
But Lord Shadow has taken over this case,
as you know.

18:56.170 --> 18:57.170
Yes.

18:57.420 --> 19:00.210
He made contact with her today,

19:01.130 --> 19:03.040
but he did not punish her.

19:03.880 --> 19:05.920
Either there's something he's after,

19:05.920 --> 19:07.540
he's waiting to see what she does,

19:07.540 --> 19:09.540
or there's some even deeper purpose.

19:10.420 --> 19:12.290
It's beyond our understanding.

19:12.960 --> 19:15.580
There is a view of the world that only he can see.

19:17.460 --> 19:20.710
It must be a very lonely view.

19:21.630 --> 19:25.000
We will trust Lord Shadow's judgment
in the matter of Number 666.

19:25.420 --> 19:26.420
Very well.

19:26.420 --> 19:29.170
The problem is the ring they found at the ruins.

19:30.250 --> 19:33.580
If we put undue pressure on them,
they might use the key.

19:34.080 --> 19:36.210
And if the legends are true, the kingdom will...

19:36.830 --> 19:39.540
Is the Black Rose that dangerous?

19:39.790 --> 19:42.670
Once, when the Oriana Kingdom was
threatened with annihilation,

19:42.670 --> 19:47.000
they used it to wipe out the Velgaltan troops that
were bearing down on the royal capital.

19:47.000 --> 19:48.250
100,000 of them in a single night.

19:48.250 --> 19:50.080
That story is more than just a fairy tale.

19:50.630 --> 19:53.920
But this time, the power will be used
to destroy the Oriana Kingdom.

19:54.330 --> 19:55.750
We must work carefully.

19:55.750 --> 19:57.170
First, we find the exact location of the key-

19:57.170 --> 19:59.000
Ah, that was nice.

19:59.460 --> 20:01.330
I love big bath tubs.

20:01.880 --> 20:03.880
That's my girl, Epsilon.

20:03.880 --> 20:06.380
We both know coffee milk is
the best thing after a bath.

20:06.580 --> 20:07.920
It's my honor!

20:10.500 --> 20:13.790
Please, come this way,
and I'll massage your shoulders.

20:13.790 --> 20:15.420
This brings back memories.

20:15.420 --> 20:19.080
I remember when Eta said she was testing
a new mechanical massager,

20:19.080 --> 20:20.960
and she made Beta scream.

20:21.210 --> 20:24.250
Those were the days when we could
be together every day.

20:24.790 --> 20:29.500
I hope you can relax and enjoy this precious moment
just as if you were back in old times.

20:30.790 --> 20:33.080
<i>Even when he's undercover as
an average halfwit student,</i>

20:33.080 --> 20:34.830
<i>he's a vision of magnificence.</i>

20:35.130 --> 20:37.040
Oh, yeah, about that thing.

20:37.040 --> 20:39.040
It looks like it'll be taken care of
sooner than expected.

20:39.040 --> 20:42.000
It's only your first day undercover,
and you've already...

20:42.000 --> 20:43.000
Yup.

20:43.000 --> 20:45.330
As far as that goes, it's practically already over.

20:45.710 --> 20:47.290
You handled it so easily!

20:47.290 --> 20:51.380
Yeah, I can knock out something
like that with my little finger.

20:51.630 --> 20:54.750
You're amazing, Lord Shadow!

20:56.670 --> 21:00.000
How is progress, Perv Asshat?

21:00.630 --> 21:04.710
The project is moving along
without a single hitch, Sir Mordred.

21:04.710 --> 21:06.380
The Black Rose...

21:06.380 --> 21:08.540
If we can take back its power,

21:08.540 --> 21:12.040
our authority within the Cult will be unshakable.

21:12.500 --> 21:15.210
But it seems there are some rats sniffing around.

21:15.210 --> 21:16.500
Don't get careless.

21:16.500 --> 21:17.880
No need to worry.

21:17.880 --> 21:21.420
The Ring of Succession never leaves my person.

21:21.710 --> 21:23.040
Good.

21:23.040 --> 21:27.630
When the sun rises on our success, then you, too,
will be granted a seat in Rounds.

21:27.920 --> 21:30.210
But you are not married to the princess yet.

21:30.210 --> 21:32.830
Make no mistakes, Perv Asshat.

21:33.040 --> 21:34.250
Yes, sir.

21:37.670 --> 21:38.880
Senile old fool...

21:39.580 --> 21:43.460
The key, Princess Rose, the kingdom...

21:43.460 --> 21:45.460
They're all here in my hands.

21:46.710 --> 21:49.880
What will you do about it, Shadow Garden?

21:50.380 --> 21:52.210
Oh, Perv, where are you?

21:52.630 --> 21:53.830
Perv!

21:57.330 --> 21:58.540
Honestly!

21:59.330 --> 22:01.460
Women are so incorrigible.

22:06.670 --> 22:07.880
Perv!

22:08.080 --> 22:09.500
I was so lonely!

22:24.380 --> 22:28.250
An endlessly deep dark night
Doko made mo fukai yamiyo to<b></b>

22:28.250 --> 22:31.080
I thought, as I closed my eyes
Omotte me o tsubutteta<b></b>

22:31.080 --> 22:36.290
Still unaware of the voice of the star calling out to me
Yobikakeru hoshi no koe ni kizukenai mama<b></b>

22:36.670 --> 22:40.630
A faint light, not too bright
Mabushiku wa nai awai hi<b></b>

22:40.630 --> 22:43.380
But comforting, that's how you were
Kokochi ii sonna anata o<b></b>

22:43.380 --> 22:47.250
Before I knew it, I was following you with my eyes
Shiranu uchi ni me de oikaketa<b></b>

22:47.250 --> 22:49.830
Even if I run out of breath
Iki o kirashite<b></b>

22:50.250 --> 22:53.290
And start to stumble
Motsuresou ni natte mo<b></b>

22:53.290 --> 22:55.540
I've never felt this before
Kono kimochi wa hajimete<b></b>

22:55.540 --> 22:59.460
I can't stop the feeling
Mita koto no nai jibun ni aeru<b></b>

22:59.830 --> 23:03.290
That I can meet a me I've never seen before
Yokan ga tomaranai<b></b>

23:03.790 --> 23:06.710
I run down the path in front of me
Me no mae no michi o hashiru<b></b>

23:06.710 --> 23:09.790
I run far, even when I'm lost
Tooku, mayotte mo<b></b>

23:09.790 --> 23:13.630
If I look up, you won't have changed
Miagereba anata wa kawaranaide<b></b>

23:13.630 --> 23:16.000
You'll be there
Soko ni iru koto o<b></b>

23:16.000 --> 23:18.960
It may be strange, but I can believe it
Fushigi demo shinjirareru<b></b>

23:18.960 --> 23:22.000
Kaze ga tsuyoi hi mo
Even on windy days<b></b>

23:22.000 --> 23:26.500
I don't have to try to reach over you
Over you todokeyou to shinakutatte ii<b></b>

23:26.500 --> 23:28.830
Hey (Did you know?)
Nee (Shitteru?)<b></b>

23:28.830 --> 23:31.880
As all the stars revolve
Subete no hoshi ga mawarinagara<b></b>

23:31.880 --> 23:35.130
I keep my sights on you
Anata o mezashiteru<b></b>

23:35.130 --> 23:38.080
Polaris in the Night
